          "changeMeaning": "Initial night-sky dome and Mars starting position are revealed to the student.",
          "narration": "Welcome to your night-sky observation of Mars. Usually, Mars drifts slowly eastward night after night against the background constellations of the ecliptic\u2014passing Leo, Virgo, and Libra."
        },
