            },
            {
              "target": "epicycle_ring",
              "color": [
                1,
                0.3,
                0.3,
                1
              ]
            }
          ],
          "changeMeaning": "The geocentric components change color to represent complexity and critique.",
          "narration": "While this model successfully reproduced the loops, it was highly complex. As astronomers collected better data, they had to stack more epicycles on top of epicycles to make accurate predictions. Let's look at the modern heliocentric solution."
        }
